# Scacelith - English (reference language)
#
# One "key = value" per line, UTF-8; lines starting with '#' are comments. "\n" is a line break,
# {0} {1}... are placeholders. A value with forms separated by '|' is a plural chosen by the count
# (English: one|other; see src/i18n/i18n.h for the forms of each language).
# Every other assets/i18n/<code>.lang file translates exactly these keys (tests/i18n_tests.cpp
# checks it); a key it lacks falls back to English. Titles are written in capitals here because
# the title face (Cinzel) is an inscriptional capital face.
# Keep the sections: other parts of the game add their keys in sections of their own.

